---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { siteImages } from '../data/photos';
import { SITE_ALT } from '../data/alt-text';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Isaac Ng is an amateur photographer from Hong Kong, living in London, shooting a Nikon Z6ii when the light is worth stopping for."
>
  <article class="about page">
    <header class="about__head">
      <h1 class="title">About</h1>
    </header>

    <figure class="about__figure">
      <Image
        src={siteImages.isaac}
        alt={SITE_ALT.isaac}
        widths={[480, 960, 1440]}
        sizes="(max-width: 60rem) 92vw, 40rem"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        class="about__img"
      />
    </figure>

    {/* Newsreader appears here and nowhere else on the site. */}
    <div class="prose about__prose">
      <p>
        Isaac Ng, an amateur photographer from Hong Kong, has found his passion for capturing
        life's moments in the bustling city of London. During his spare time, he delves into
        the world of photography, using his Nikon Z6ii as his creative tool of choice.
      </p>
      <p>
        With an open minded approach to photography, Isaac embraces a wide range of subjects,
        from expressive portraits to mesmerising landscapes and the enchanting world of
        animals. His lens becomes a window into the diverse and multifaceted aspects of life,
        seeking out the hidden beauties that often go unnoticed.
      </p>
      <p>
        Rather than viewing photography as a full time pursuit, Isaac values it as a cherished
        outlet for creative expression and personal enjoyment. He takes pictures solely when
        inspiration strikes, allowing each shot to unfold organically and authentically, free
        from the constraints of forced obligations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Isaac's keen eye for detail and sensitivity to colours lend a distinctive aura to his
        photographs, inviting viewers to experience the world through his unique perspective.
        Join him on this artistic odyssey as he uncovers the beauty within the mundane and
        embraces the ever changing nature of his photographic exploration.
      </p>
    </div>

  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  @layer components {
    .about {
      padding-block: clamp(var(--space-12), 10vh, var(--space-24)) 0;
    }

    .about__head {
      padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge);
    }

    .about__figure {
      margin: var(--space-12) 0 0;
      max-width: 40rem;
    }

    .about__img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    .about__prose {
      margin-top: var(--space-12);
      color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 88%, transparent);
    }

    @media (min-width: 64rem) {
      .about {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
        column-gap: clamp(var(--space-12), 6vw, var(--space-24));
        align-items: start;
      }

      .about__head {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }

      .about__figure {
        margin-top: var(--space-16);
        position: sticky;
        top: 7rem;
      }

      .about__prose {
        grid-column: 2;
      }

      .about__prose {
        margin-top: var(--space-16);
      }
    }
  }
</style>
